2025-09-06 01:27:34  QUESTION: What is the data for Colombo from the last 7 days?  SQL: SELECT 
    "datetime",
    "tempmax",
    "tempmin",
    "temp",
    "humidity",
    "rain",
    "rainsum",
    "snow",
    "snowdepth",
    "windgust",
    "windspeed",
    "winddir",
    "sealevelpressure",
    "cloudcover",
    "visibility",
    "solarradiation",
    "solarenergy",
    "uvindex"
FROM 
    weather_data
WHERE 
    "statedistrict" = 'Colombo'
    AND "datetime" >= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL '7 day'
ORDER BY 
    "datetime" DESC
LIMIT 5
